cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "RPFR-visualizer: a browser explorer for the QM9s-RPFR isotope effects database"
abstract: >-
  A local browser explorer and Python package for the QM9s-RPFR database of
  per-atom reduced partition function ratios. Reads the QM9s HDF5 files
  (schema 2.2), searches them by identifier, composition, functional group and
  SMARTS substructure, and shows per-site values, temperature dependence,
  clumping and mass laws in 3D and 2D.
type: software
